    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gretlow Tapes </strong>is a short, atmospheric, first-person horror game. Armed with nothing but your camera, you set out to investigate the mysteries of the abandoned Gretlow House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the dread through a realistic found-footage aesthetic and foreboding sound design as you delve into a local legend that might be terrifyingly real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/505d819bb1319fbe6076748e55e392dc.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a small town in Northern England in the year 2000, you play as a local university student and amateur photographer. You've been reading rumours online about the old, abandoned house on the edge of town. They say the previous owner met a violent end, and that anyone who tries to stay the night is never seen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dismissed it as urban legend\u2014until the disappearances started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you're determined to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the night?</strong> One thing is certain: <strong>you will not be alone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/59659e0ac59fa38963bc31c035abaa2b.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the oppressive atmosphere of the Gretlow House as you explore its dark halls and hidden rooms. Every sound echoes through the lifeless husk of this long-forgotten manor, where something unseen lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.poster.avif?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.webm?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.mp4?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/3745c794b734824bbe982a1fd8489c68.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the lens of your camera to capture your discoveries as you uncover what really happened at Gretlow House all those years ago. Gather evidence in your photo album and use your camera to interact with the memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.poster.avif?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.webm?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.mp4?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gretlow Tapes </strong>is a short, atmospheric, first-person horror game. Armed with nothing but your camera, you set out to investigate the mysteries of the abandoned Gretlow House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the dread through a realistic found-footage aesthetic and foreboding sound design as you delve into a local legend that might be terrifyingly real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/505d819bb1319fbe6076748e55e392dc.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a small town in Northern England in the year 2000, you play as a local university student and amateur photographer. You've been reading rumours online about the old, abandoned house on the edge of town. They say the previous owner met a violent end, and that anyone who tries to stay the night is never seen again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dismissed it as urban legend\u2014until the disappearances started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you're determined to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the night?</strong> One thing is certain: <strong>you will not be alone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/59659e0ac59fa38963bc31c035abaa2b.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the oppressive atmosphere of the Gretlow House as you explore its dark halls and hidden rooms. Every sound echoes through the lifeless husk of this long-forgotten manor, where something unseen lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.poster.avif?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.webm?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/885e54aff46d6484ed8bbf36000e9291.mp4?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/3745c794b734824bbe982a1fd8489c68.webp?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the lens of your camera to capture your discoveries as you uncover what really happened at Gretlow House all those years ago. Gather evidence in your photo album and use your camera to interact with the memories of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.poster.avif?t=1754991404\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.webm?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433230/extras/423a2a2b9201b9d35f4171354c47a70d.mp4?t=1754991404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
